- Card c: "2 days before check-in" with same flex layout

**Fix 2: CHANNEL TAGS** - Removed channel-specific tag classes, used plain `<span class=tag>`:
- All 3 cards now have `<div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap: var(--sp-2);">` wrapping:
  - `<span class="tag"><span class="icon">chat</span> WhatsApp</span>`
  - `<span class="icon">arrow_forward</span>` (no tag wrapper)
  - `<span class="tag"><span class="icon">mail</span> Email</span>`

**Fix 3: EDIT BUTTON** - Simplified to `class="btn btn--text"`:
- Changed from `class="btn btn--text icon edit Edit template"` to `class="btn btn--text"`
- Icon and text now inside: `<span class="icon">edit</span>Edit template`

**Fix 4: PREVIEW** - Split first line, moved stats outside:
- First line of each preview in `<p class="t-title-small">` only (removed " / " separator)
- Rest of text in `<p class="t-body-medium">`
